<!-- The Kennzeichnungen pictures, one DrawingImage per Kennzeichen.PictureKey. Converted from the
     public-domain SVGs named above each picture: every shape became path data in a 0..100 box,
     transforms and arcs flattened into it, so the XAML needs no SVG library. ADR 6.1 and 8 get a
     white diamond underneath because their files leave the white parts of the label transparent.
     Regenerate rather than edit by hand, and check every new file's licence on its Commons page
     before it goes in (issue #21). -->
